sequenceDiagram
    actor U as User
    participant F as Frontend
    participant B as Backend Report Service
    participant D as PostgreSQL
    U->>F: Generate report
    F->>B: POST /chats/{id}/reports
    B->>D: Load thread, evidence, latest analysis and retrieval
    B->>B: Build immutable input snapshot and hash
    B->>D: Check idempotency key
    alt Existing key with same snapshot
        D-->>B: Existing report
    else Key conflict
        B-->>F: 409 report_idempotency_conflict
    else New snapshot
        B->>B: Build deterministic 7-section report
        B->>B: Validate source and MITRE identifiers
        B->>D: Persist next report version
        B-->>F: Completed report
    end
    U->>F: Download PDF
    F->>B: GET /reports/{report_id}/pdf
    B-->>F: application/pdf, no-store

